  <entry>
    <title>Linux 学习笔记2</title>
    <link href="/2025/11/02/LinuxLearning-2/"/>
    <url>/2025/11/02/LinuxLearning-2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="Bash-脚本编程"><a href="#Bash-脚本编程" class="headerlink" title="Bash 脚本编程"></a>Bash 脚本编程</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-meta">#!/bin/bash</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#hello.sh</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hello world&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">chmod</span> +x ./hello.sh<span class="hljs-comment">#x是赋予hello.sh运行权限</span><br>./hello.sh<span class="hljs-comment">#可以使用相对/绝对路径</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="变量"><a href="#变量" class="headerlink" title="变量"></a>变量</h4><p>shell中，所有变量默认为字符串<br>使用变量：${var}</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">a=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;777&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">readonly</span> a<span class="hljs-comment">#a只可读，后续不可改</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 命令返回值赋值</span><br>a=$(<span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span>) <span class="hljs-comment">#等号不能有空格</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="接受输入"><a href="#接受输入" class="headerlink" title="接受输入"></a>接受输入</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># read -p 提示信息 变量名</span><br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">read</span> -p <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Enter the filepath: &quot;</span> filepath<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>环境变量：名称不可改，变量值可改</p><p>设置环境变量：export …，临时设置环境变量，在本shell及其子shell可用</p><p>永久生效：进入&#x2F;etc&#x2F;profile配置文件，export 环境变量，退出后source &#x2F;etc&#x2F;profile</p><h4 id="运算符"><a href="#运算符" class="headerlink" title="运算符"></a>运算符</h4><h5 id="算术运算符"><a href="#算术运算符" class="headerlink" title="算术运算符"></a>算术运算符</h5><p>bash不支持简单算数运算，需使用 expr，不支持a++，但可以如下</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">a=10<br>b=20<br><br>val=`<span class="hljs-built_in">expr</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> + <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>`<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a + b : <span class="hljs-variable">$val</span>&quot;</span><br><br>val=`<span class="hljs-built_in">expr</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> - <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>`<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a - b : <span class="hljs-variable">$val</span>&quot;</span><br><br>val=`<span class="hljs-built_in">expr</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> \* <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>`<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a * b : <span class="hljs-variable">$val</span>&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> [ <span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> != <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span> ]<br><span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br>   <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a 不等于 b&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">fi</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 两种自增自减</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">let</span> a++<br>((a--))<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><span style="color:red;">表达式与运算符间要有空格，条件表达式要有方括号</span></p><h5 id="比较运算符"><a href="#比较运算符" class="headerlink" title="比较运算符"></a>比较运算符</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">a=10<br>b=20<br><span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> -eq <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span> =<br>-ne !=<br>-lt&lt;<br>-ge&gt;<br>-le &lt;=<br>-ge =&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="逻辑运算符"><a href="#逻辑运算符" class="headerlink" title="逻辑运算符"></a>逻辑运算符</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">-a <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="流程控制"><a href="#流程控制" class="headerlink" title="流程控制"></a>流程控制</h4><h5 id="if"><a href="#if" class="headerlink" title="if"></a>if</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> [<span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> -gt <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>]<br><span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a&gt;b&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> [<span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> -eq <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>]<br><span class="hljs-keyword">then</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;a equal b&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;no result&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">fi</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><span style="color:red">注意 fi 结尾 </span></p><h5 id="for"><a href="#for" class="headerlink" title="for"></a>for</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> loop <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> 1 2 3 4 5<br><span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;The value is: <span class="hljs-variable">$loop</span>&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">done</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="while"><a href="#while" class="headerlink" title="while"></a>while</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> condition<br><span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">command</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">done</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="case"><a href="#case" class="headerlink" title="case"></a>case</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">read</span> -p <span class="hljs-string">&quot;enter a num between 1 and 4: &quot;</span> num<br><span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$num</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span><br>        1)      <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;you entered 1&quot;</span><br>        ;;<br>        2)      <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;you enter 2&quot;</span>;;<br>        3)      <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;3&quot;</span><br>        ;;<br>        4)      <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;4&quot;</span>;;<br>        *)      <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;false input&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">esac</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>获取时间</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">date</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 示例输出：Wed Nov  5 10:30:00 CST 2025</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">#可自定义格式（通过 +格式符），例如：</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">date</span> +<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S&quot;</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># 年-月-日 时:分:秒</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 输出：2025-11-05 10:30:00</span><br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">date</span> +<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s&quot;</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># 时间戳（从1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC到现在的秒数）</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 输出：1762276200</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></blockquote><h4 id="定时执行（日志编写）"><a href="#定时执行（日志编写）" class="headerlink" title="定时执行（日志编写）"></a>定时执行（日志编写）</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">crontab -e<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>首次执行时需对当前用户创建，会提示选择编辑器，进入编辑后会有文本提示使用方法</p></blockquote><p>e.g. 在文件末尾添加以下一行（核心配置）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">0 3 * * * /path/to/backup.sh &gt;&gt; /var/log/backup.log 2&gt;&amp;1<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>2&gt;&amp;1</code>：将<strong>错误输出（stderr）</strong> 重定向到标准输出，最终也写入日志（确保错误信息也被记录</p><blockquote><p>在 Linux 中，程序的输出分为两种：</p><ul><li><strong>标准输出（stdout）</strong>：程序正常运行时的输出信息，编号为 1</li><li><strong>标准错误（stderr）</strong>：程序运行出错时的提示信息，编号为 2</li></ul></blockquote><h2 id="学习检测"><a href="#学习检测" class="headerlink" title="学习检测"></a>学习检测</h2><blockquote><p>以下是我让AI出的一些基础题目来检测最基本的学习结果——其实就是帮你复习下😘和补充——快来试下吧</p></blockquote><hr><h3 id="Level-1：基础命令与系统操作"><a href="#Level-1：基础命令与系统操作" class="headerlink" title="Level 1：基础命令与系统操作"></a><strong>Level 1：基础命令与系统操作</strong></h3><p>（检测：是否熟悉Linux常用命令与文件系统）</p><p><strong>任务 1：文件与目录操作</strong></p><ol><li>在 <code>/home/你的用户名</code> 下创建一个名为 <code>project_test</code> 的目录</li><li>在其中创建三个文件：<code>a.txt</code>, <code>b.txt</code>, <code>c.txt</code></li><li>将 <code>b.txt</code> 移动到一个子目录 <code>backup</code> 中</li><li>压缩整个 <code>project_test</code> 文件夹为 <code>project_test.tar.gz</code></li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>mkdir</code>, <code>touch</code>, <code>mv</code>, <code>tar</code>, <code>ls</code>, <code>cd</code> 等命令</p></blockquote><hr><p><strong>任务 2：权限与用户管理</strong></p><ol><li>新建一个用户 <code>testuser</code>，为其设置密码</li><li>给该用户赋予对 <code>/home/你的用户名/project_test</code> 的读写权限</li><li>再撤销它的写权限，只保留读</li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>useradd</code>, <code>passwd</code>, <code>chmod</code>, <code>chown</code>, <code>ls -l</code></p></blockquote><hr><p><strong>任务 3：进程与系统状态</strong></p><ol><li>查看当前运行的进程中哪个进程占用CPU最高</li><li>杀掉一个你启动的后台进程</li><li>查看磁盘使用情况与内存占用情况</li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>top</code>, <code>ps</code>, <code>kill</code>, <code>df</code>, <code>free</code></p></blockquote><hr><h3 id="Level-2：脚本与自动化"><a href="#Level-2：脚本与自动化" class="headerlink" title="Level 2：脚本与自动化"></a><strong>Level 2：脚本与自动化</strong></h3><p>（检测：能否用shell写基础脚本）</p><p><strong>任务 4：编写一个bash脚本</strong><br> 功能如下：</p><ul><li><p>脚本名：<code>backup.sh</code></p></li><li><p>输入一个文件夹路径参数，例如：</p>  <figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">.<span class="hljs-regexp">/backup.sh /</span>home<span class="hljs-regexp">/evan/</span>data<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>程序自动压缩该文件夹为带时间戳的压缩包，例如：</p>  <figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">data_backup_2025</span>-<span class="hljs-number">10</span>-<span class="hljs-number">15</span>.tar.gz<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>bash变量</code>、<code>$1</code> 参数传入、<code>date</code> 命令、<code>tar</code> 命令、<code>if</code> 判断</p></blockquote><hr><p><strong>任务 5：计划任务</strong></p><ol><li>每天凌晨3点执行 <code>backup.sh</code></li><li>输出日志到 <code>/var/log/backup.log</code></li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>crontab</code>, <code>echo</code>, 重定向 <code>&gt;&gt;</code></p></blockquote><hr><h3 id="Level-3：系统与网络"><a href="#Level-3：系统与网络" class="headerlink" title="Level 3：系统与网络"></a><strong>Level 3：系统与网络</strong></h3><p>（检测：是否理解Linux系统结构）</p><p><strong>任务 6：软件与服务</strong></p><ol><li>安装 <code>nginx</code> 并启动服务</li><li>设置开机自启</li><li>修改默认主页内容并验证访问</li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>apt</code>, <code>systemctl</code>, <code>/etc/nginx/sites-available/</code>, <code>curl</code></p></blockquote><hr><p><strong>任务 7：网络与端口</strong></p><ol><li>查看当前系统监听的端口</li><li>找到哪个进程占用了80端口</li><li>用 <code>curl</code> 或 <code>ping</code> 测试某个网站的连通性</li></ol><blockquote><p> 要点考察：<code>netstat</code>, <code>ss</code>, <code>lsof</code>, <code>ping</code>, <code>curl</code></p></blockquote><hr><h3 id="附加挑战"><a href="#附加挑战" class="headerlink" title="附加挑战"></a>附加挑战</h3><p>写一个脚本：</p><ul><li>自动检测你的系统是否联网</li><li>如果联网，就显示“网络正常”；否则自动尝试 <code>ping 8.8.8.8</code> 三次</li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
    
